> there are many container registries like dockerhub,quay.io,ECR on aws etc
> can use docker push to upload images
> need to specify registry
 1. docker hub - docker login docker.io 
 2. quay.io    - docker login quay.io
 3. ECR        - docker login <ecr location> or ARN

 eg; docker push docker.io/akhil/product-catalog:v2
 > docker.io - registry
 > akhil     - username 
 > product-catalog  - repository in dockerhub
 > :v2       - tag
